    h1: 'Turf and putting green care in Burgess',
    intro: `Burgess is the southern edge of where we work, 28 square miles between the Waccamaw River and the US 17 Bypass that went from about 3,000 people in 1990 to more than 31,000 by 2018. Almost all of that growth is golf: the TPC Myrtle Beach community, Blackmoor and Laurel Woods nearby, and Cypress River Plantation, a gated 500-plus-lot community on the Intracoastal with its own boat landing. Sixty neighborhoods, by the Greater Burgess Community Association's own count, on ground that was mostly rural a generation ago. A backyard green here is common; a backyard green cleaned right is not.`,
    question: 'Who restores putting greens and cleans turf in Burgess?',
    answer: `TIMELESS Turf Restoration cleans and restores artificial turf and backyard putting greens across Burgess, including the neighborhoods around TPC Myrtle Beach, Blackmoor and Cypress River Plantation. Owner-operated by Brian, 13 years in turf and putting greens. Turf cleaned from $199, deodorized from $299; greens cleared, top-dressed, brushed and rolled, priced by square foot.`,
