    question: 'Who cleans artificial turf in Sunset Beach?',
    answer: `TIMELESS Turf Restoration cleans, deodorizes and restores artificial turf and putting greens across Sunset Beach, from the island's vacation rentals to Sea Trail Plantation, Thistle Golf Estates and Sandpiper Bay on the mainland. Owner-operated by Brian, 13 years in turf. Essential Clean from $199, Premium Restoration from $299, priced by square foot; post-storm checks after any tropical system.`,
